cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CascadeScope or the Immune Cascade Index (ICI), please cite this software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "CascadeScope: single-patient Immune Cascade Index (ICI) scoring"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained R/Shiny application that computes and visualizes the Immune
  Cascade Index (ICI), a 98-gene, three-layer (Sensory, Integration, Execution)
  transcriptomic read-out of the anti-tumor immune response to immune-checkpoint
  blockade. Each tumor RNA-seq sample is self-normalized and scored against a
  frozen, locked per-gene reference, so the score is deterministic and
  cohort-independent for a single patient. Research use only.
type: software
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23980406
